{"src":"en","tgt":"ht","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ht","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5812.526799,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6186.518237,"text":"Lyon se chat ki pi sosyo yo, yo viv nan gwo gwoup yo rele \"prides\"."},{"kind":"audio","t":6244.897453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6250.182922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":6255.567388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6261.077483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6262.881269,"samples":13087,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":11429.587475,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11818.853155,"text":"Nan klima cho Mwayen Oryan an, kay la pa t tèlman enpòtan."},{"kind":"audio","t":11866.283479999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11871.783664999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11877.576926999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11880.528966000002,"samples":20473,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":17733.497556000002,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18231.794944,"text":"Yo prèske tout plaj sab kote yo ka naje an sekirite epi pifò gen lonbraj ki soti nan"},{"kind":"audio","t":18287.497737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18292.946413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":18298.431519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18303.722647000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18308.806158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18314.228814000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18318.904801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18321.575644,"samples":27088,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":20580.658124,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20717.647663,"text":"pyebwa Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20761.148292,"samples":31615,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1250},{"kind":"input","t":26132.144191,"text":"Brides are made up of 1 to 3 related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26663.039506,"text":"Brid yo konpoze de 1 a 3 machbèl ki gen rapò youn ak lòt ansanm avèk nou."},{"kind":"audio","t":26712.233348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26717.281559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26723.11121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26728.888001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26731.319708000003,"samples":17158,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":32635.214015999998,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33167.580391,"text":"Timoun feral yo ka te sibi maltraitans grav oswa trauma anvan yo te abandone oswa anvan yo te kouri ale."},{"kind":"audio","t":33222.265838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33227.689124000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33233.318678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":33239.04383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33244.826891000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":33250.445525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33255.118301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33256.131088,"samples":15115,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":38536.739206,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 travels regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":39006.316204,"text":"Bis 403 Scottport la vwayaje regilyèman ale Centra epi li kanpe nan Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":39056.536632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39061.462895000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39066.911711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39072.86521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":39079.162544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39080.979530000004,"samples":14322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":45859.61616,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46361.794835,"text":"Pou ou jwenn pi bèl vue Hong Kong, kite zile a epi dirije w nan bò lanmè Kowloon ki anfas la."},{"kind":"audio","t":46414.052835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46419.719308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"audio","t":46425.110945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46431.128573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46436.449121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":46442.604927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46445.077973,"samples":18430,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":51223.103851,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51629.072784,"text":"Yo te aksepte vizyon Aristote sou tout keksyon syans, enkli fizyoloji."},{"kind":"audio","t":51678.552142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51683.829490000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":51689.445544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51694.943379000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51700.838599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51701.339922,"samples":6660,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":61161.031217,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor"},{"kind":"text","t":61725.017593000004,"text":"Mitchell Gowrie, ki soti Ostrali, te fini 11èm nan konkou Super G gason an, konpetitè Chet la."},{"kind":"audio","t":61777.968183000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":61784.06791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":480,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":61789.835902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61795.629053000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":61800.926291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61807.110907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61810.444952,"samples":23938,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":67028.77373599999,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67450.24128799999,"text":"Ulrich Joklin te fini 16èm nan konkou Super G gason an, nan kategori chita."},{"kind":"audio","t":67501.85199699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67506.681111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67512.358704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67518.103076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":67523.81163899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":580,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67525.772952,"samples":14801,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":73779.418077,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74299.028196,"text":"Vil la gen yon kontras frape ak rès vil yo nan peyi a paske li gen plis yon style Arab pase yon style Arab."},{"kind":"audio","t":74350.680264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74355.948532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74361.004494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74366.80020499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74372.14126199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74377.557609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74380.057105,"samples":17951,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":84760.906972,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85470.09853399999,"text":"Epi, apre revolisyon an, pòs yo te ouvè pou tout kandida gason, sa ki te pèmèt moun ki te plis anbisye ak siksè yo reyisi."},{"kind":"audio","t":85526.348629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85531.84679499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85537.57805699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":85543.26365899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":85548.968442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85554.39641799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85558.769829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85561.994155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85564.501691,"samples":26407,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"input","t":91857.496181,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92507.31117999999,"text":"Bonb fisyon an fonksyone sou prensip ki di li pran enèji pou mete ansanm yon nikleyo ki gen anpil pwoton ak netwon."},{"kind":"audio","t":92560.84002199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":92565.94088299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":92571.10367299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92577.32187799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92582.98975099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92588.38562799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92593.133124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92594.594724,"samples":17510,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":97446.178852,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97962.719212,"text":"Li pa t fikse yon chif pou koupe yo, li di y ap fèt baze sou pwodiksyon ekonomik Lachin."},{"kind":"audio","t":98013.52240199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98019.258074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":98025.250512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98030.692438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98036.31152199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98039.89317299999,"samples":23421,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":105766.974834,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106164.709339,"text":"Pa gen yon definisyon inivèsèl pou ki atik fabrikasyon ki se antik. Gen kèk ajans taks ki defini machandiz ki gen plis pase 100 an."},{"kind":"audio","t":106217.48126199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106223.022747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":106228.752979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106234.420162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106235.445798,"samples":9974,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"audio","t":106281.72775899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106286.913808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":106292.579071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106297.894869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":106298.619129,"samples":636,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113933.70082,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114290.91383599999,"text":"Nan achipèl la ak lak yo, ou pa nesesèman bezwen yon yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":114338.39318099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114344.36744999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"audio","t":114349.82144599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114353.81537099999,"samples":26459,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":123573.18193199999,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124390.47937599999,"text":"Rapò dimansyon fòma sa a, lè yo divize l pa 12 pou jwenn rapò nimewo antye ki pi senp lan, se poutèt sa yo di li se 3 pou 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124454.75887199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124459.94557099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124465.446237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124470.928172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124476.23354999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124481.580167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":124486.60134899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124489.33116199999,"samples":28525,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":131846.950984,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132402.656362,"text":"Li renome pou li se yon episantri liks ki te kòmanse vè 400 AD epi ki te dire jiska u"},{"kind":"audio","t":132452.46770500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132457.54652600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":132462.861974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132468.46910800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132474.040442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132478.56496000002,"samples":28929,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":136085.915457,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136305.308356,"text":"jiska vè 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":136348.87600400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136349.241159,"samples":3157,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":145374.145173,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146186.52276300002,"text":"Polis anilasyon yo varye, men depi fen mas la, pifò polis anilasyon ki baze sou koronavirus yo pa rive jiska jiyè 2020 lè Jolimpiyik la"},{"kind":"audio","t":146256.18325600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146261.729081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":146267.41626300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146273.449021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"audio","t":146279.04511500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146284.418842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146288.657505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146292.257646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":146295.801908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146299.093723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146302.69035400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146303.17372700002,"samples":7124,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":154639.028165,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155185.586618,"text":"Melanje de poud sèch yo ansanm, epi avèk men pwòp ki mouye, peze yo pou fè yon boul."},{"kind":"audio","t":155236.071112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155242.03131000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":155247.501236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":155253.594233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":155259.038149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155260.122455,"samples":9294,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":162236.062643,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162569.68104,"text":"Krousyè St. Petersburg yo gen ladan yo tan nan lavil la. Pasajè kwiz yo eskize nan kondisyon viza yo."},{"kind":"audio","t":162616.37017500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162618.07808200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162619.927117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":162621.069251,"samples":21670,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":162677.775101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162683.288856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162686.30900500002,"samples":23309,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"close","t":173504.88660300002,"code":1005}]}